[35mpostgres-db                |[0m 	The root cause of the outage was a single root cause, but it is not specified in the text.
[35mpostgres-db                |[0m 	
[35mpostgres-db                |[0m 	The outage started at 9:28 AM PST on December 7th, 2021, and lasted for approximately 6 hours and 54 minutes. The downtime period began when the monitoring data was still not visible to the operations team, which delayed their understanding of the event.
[35mpostgres-db                |[0m 	
[35mpostgres-db                |[0m 	Here is a summary of the outage:
[35mpostgres-db                |[0m 	
[35mpostgres-db                |[0m 	* Start time: 9:28 AM PST on December 7th, 2021
[35mpostgres-db                |[0m 	* End time: 4:41 PM PST on December 7th, 2021
[35mpostgres-db                |[0m 	* Duration: approximately 6 hours and 54 minutes
[35mpostgres-db                |[0m 	* Downtime period: started when monitoring data was still not visible to the operations team
[35mpostgres-db                |[0m 	* Resolution time: 8:22 AM PST on December 7th, 2021 (when the Service Health Dashboard was successfully updated)
[35mpostgres-db                |[0m 	
